	"title"            "Fixed Coop Synergies"
	"description"      "[h1]Fixed Coop Synergies[/h1]
Turns Brotato co-op into a team game: every one of the 64 characters gets an active skill, characters that share a theme form factions that buff (and nerf) the whole team, and every character has a role, so a co-op party becomes a team comp.

This is a fixed and rebalanced fork of [url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3745283747]Co-op Synergies[/url] by [b]hhoangg (byptah)[/b], who designed the mod, its skills and its icons. [b]Don't enable both mods at once.[/b]

[h1]What's fixed[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Stats no longer go negative.[/b] Ending a skill buff could leave Dodge, Speed or Armor below where they started (Dodge near -900%), and some buffs gave 100% Dodge while they lasted. Every buff now uses the game's own temporary-stat system and ends exactly where it started.
[*][b]Damage and XP Gain buffs now work[/b] (they did nothing before), and attack speed, crit, range and engineering buffs now reach your weapons and turrets, not just the stat panel.
[*][b]Every character has a faction.[/b] Two new ones, Iron Fists and All-Rounders, plus Ranger, Sick, Loud and Farmer join existing factions.
[*][b]Faction nerfs never push a stat below 0[/b] and never cost you materials.
[*]Enemies hit by a freeze and a slow together no longer stay frozen or slowed for the rest of the wave. Saver's and Buccaneer's material drops now pay out.
[/list]

[h1]What it adds[/h1]
[b]Active skills[/b]: all 64 characters get their own ability that fits who they are. The Engineer deploys a turret, the Ghost phases through enemies, the Creature leaves a curse cloud, the Lich chains lightning, and so on. A skill unlocks at level 6 and gets stronger every 6 levels (5 tiers). Skill damage grows with the wave and with your Damage stat, so skills stay useful deep into Endless.

[b]Cooldowns by class[/b]: light skills recharge fast (about 4 casts a wave), most are normal (about 2), and big payoff skills are slow (about 1).

[b]Factions[/b]: when 2 or more characters from the same faction are in the run, the whole team gets a buff and a smaller nerf; 3 or more makes both bigger. Some pairs give an extra bonus (Mage + Apprentice, King + Knight, Hunter + Ranger).
[list]
[*][b]Same Boat[/b]: Buccaneer, Captain, Sailor, Diver, Fisherman. +Luck, +Speed; -Armor.
[*][b]Arcane[/b]: Mage, Apprentice, Lich, Druid, Technomage. +Elemental Damage; -Max HP.
[*][b]Machines[/b]: Engineer, Artificer, Cyborg, Golem, Technomage. +Engineering; -Dodge.
[*][b]The Damned[/b]: Demon, Vampire, Lich, Ghost, Cryptid, Creature, Sick. +Life Steal; -HP Regeneration.
[*][b]Crown & Steel[/b]: King, Knight, Gladiator, Soldier, Captain. +Melee Damage, +Armor; -Range.
[*][b]The Wild[/b]: Wildling, Beast Master, Hunter, Ogre, Bull, Cryptid, Ranger. +Crit, +Attack Speed; -Engineering.
[*][b]Iron Fists[/b]: Brawler, One-Armed, Dwarf, Ogre. +Melee Damage, +Max HP; -Dodge.
[*][b]Hustlers[/b]: Arms Dealer, Entrepreneur, Streamer, Saver, Gangster, Jack. +Harvesting; -Damage.
[*][b]The Caretakers[/b]: Doctor, Romantic, Pacifist, Lucky, Old, Chef. +HP Regeneration; -Attack Speed.
[*][b]Reckless[/b]: Crazy, Masochist, Renegade, Mutant, Wounded, Loud. +Damage, +Attack Speed; -Max HP.
[*][b]Late Bloomers[/b]: Baby, Glutton, Hiker, Builder, Chunky, Mutant, Farmer. +Max HP, +Harvesting; -Speed.
[*][b]Drifters[/b]: Explorer, Speedy, Vagabond, Curious, Hiker. +Speed, +Dodge; -Armor.
[*][b]All-Rounders[/b]: Generalist, Well-Rounded, Multitasker, Vagabond. A little of everything; -Crit.
[/list]

[b]Roles[/b]: every character reads as Carry, Caster, Tank, Support, Late, Skirmisher or Flex. The character-select screen shows each skill's numbers and each character's factions.

[h1]Controls[/h1]
Press [b]Space[/b] (keyboard) or the [b]bottom face button[/b] (A on Xbox) during a wave to use your skill. In co-op each player uses their own. Skills are a co-op feature. Turn the whole system on or off with the [b]Synergies[/b] checkbox in the character-select Run Options panel, right under Co-op (on by default).

Requires Godot Mod Loader.

[h1]Source code and credits[/h1]
[b]Repository:[/b] [url=https://github.com/Redsuperninja/brotato-synergies]github.com/Redsuperninja/brotato-synergies[/url]. Bug reports and balance feedback are welcome as GitHub issues or as comments here.
Original mod, skill design and all 64 skill icons by [b]hhoangg (byptah)[/b]: [url=https://github.com/hhoangg/brotato-synergies]github.com/hhoangg/brotato-synergies[/url]. Code MIT, icons and preview art CC BY 4.0 (the preview's title was changed for this fork). If you enjoy it, consider supporting the original author: [url=https://ko-fi.com/hhoangg]ko-fi.com/hhoangg[/url]
Unofficial fan mod, not affiliated with Blobfish."
	"changenote"       "v0.40.0, first release of Fixed Coop Synergies (a fork of Co-op Synergies by hhoangg). Stats can no longer go negative: every skill buff and faction trait now uses the game's own temporary-stat system. Damage and XP Gain buffs now actually apply, as do attack speed, crit, range and engineering on weapons and turrets. Faction nerfs never push a stat below zero. Two new factions (Iron Fists, All-Rounders) so all 64 characters have one. Enemy slows and freezes no longer leave enemies stuck. Saver and Buccaneer material drops now pay out."
}
